# What Vercel does not need to build the public site.
#
# The build is `pnpm --filter @exdate/web build`, so the upload must still carry
# every workspace package.json - `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` verifies the
# lockfile against all of them and fails on a missing one. Only artifacts and
# local state are excluded here, never sources.

.ponder/
packages/indexer/.ponder/
*.log
.next/
out/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vercel/
.github/
